# Parts analysis -> dynamic HTML, one house style

Jerome (2026-10-07): *"can you make a memory to do all parts analysis in this style"* - pointing at the
pricing-revision file he sent Suzuki san. Applies to **every** parts / backlog / GPS / PMS / pricing
analysis that becomes a deliverable: a distributor view, a family view, a case study, a worklist.

## Form (non-negotiable)

- **One self-contained `.html`.** No CDN, no sibling JSON fetch. Payload inline in
  `<script type="application/json" id="payload">`. It must paint from `file://` on double-click
  (`isze-html-openable.mdc`). Chart.js is inlined, never linked.
- **Sibling `OPEN_*.cmd`** (CRLF) next to it. Do not auto-start it unless he says open now.
- Kept large files are fine: 6-9 MB is normal and expected. Size is not a reason for a launcher.

## Screens

- **Chart first, not table first.** The point of the page is the chart. Tables only as a short top-N
  with the line-level detail behind a click.
- **Picker = the business question:** distributor / market, parts family, SaTy (SOR / VOR / RUSH),
  period. Never a raw chart-type selector.
- **Drill down** from every aggregate to the lines behind it.
- **KPI tiles** carry a hover tooltip with the definition, the window and what is excluded.
- Chart **titles state the question** ("who is holding the oldest open volume"), never the folder name.

## Numbers

- **Euros first.** A piece count alone is not a finding - pair it with the parts family, the euro at an
  observed selling price, and the fleet/rate behind it (`isze-gaps-need-context.mdc`,
  `isze-analytical-conventions.mdc`).
- **%GM / margin**, never markup factors or class factors (`isze-spoken-labels.mdc`).
- **Fiscal year** as the default window (FY2026 = 1 Apr 2025 - 31 Mar 2026), same as GPS and Power BI.
- Name the source file and the as-of date in a footnote, not in the headline.
- No invented figure. If a number is not observed, print the gap and say so.

## Look

- Navy `#15233c`, terracotta `#c0552d`, paper `#f7f4ee`, ink `#222`. Georgia headings,
  system sans body. Never white text on a pale row (`dashboard-contrast-kpi.mdc`).
- Reference builds to imitate: `02_dashboards/pricing/ISZE_Pricing_Revision_AIM_Source.html` (6.6 MB,
  the file sent to Suzuki san), `02_dashboards/sales/ISZE_AIM_Comparison_ALL.html` (8.2 MB),
  `02_dashboards/sales/ISZE_AIM_DB_DLR_Deep_Dive_ALL.html` (7.2 MB).

## Gate

Still read-only until he says rebuild or ship (`isze-no-ship-without-ok.mdc`). Before claiming done:
verify the rendered page paints and contains its rows (`isze-verify-rendered-output.mdc`,
`isze-ship-gate.mdc`).
